اختبار StateFlow و SharedFlow باستخدام Turbine ومحاكاة انبعاثات الـ ViewModel:
```kotlin
class NotificationViewModel : ViewModel() {
    // StateFlow للحالة المستمرة
    private val _uiState = MutableStateFlow<String>("Initial")
    val uiState: StateFlow<String> = _uiState.asStateFlow()

    // SharedFlow للأحداث الفردية السريعة (One-off snackbar events)
    private val _events = MutableSharedFlow<String>()
    val events: SharedFlow<String> = _events.asSharedFlow()

    fun updateState(newValue: String) {
        _uiState.value = newValue
    }

    fun triggerAlert(message: String) {
        viewModelScope.launch {
            _events.emit(message)
        }
    }
}

class FlowTurbineTest {
    @get:Rule
    val mainDispatcherRule = MainDispatcherRule()

    @Test
    fun `test StateFlow emissions with Turbine`() = runTest {
        val viewModel = NotificationViewModel()

        viewModel.uiState.test {
            // 1. أول عنصر دائماً هو القيمة الابتدائية للـ StateFlow:
            assertEquals("Initial", awaitItem())

            viewModel.updateState("Updated")
            assertEquals("Updated", awaitItem())

            expectNoEvents()
        }
    }

    @Test
    fun `test SharedFlow requires collecting before emitting`() = runTest {
        val viewModel = NotificationViewModel()

        viewModel.events.test {
            // 2. يجب بدء الـ test block أولاً، ثم استدعاء دالة الإرسال:
            viewModel.triggerAlert("Error occurred")
            mainDispatcherRule.testDispatcher.scheduler.runCurrent()

            assertEquals("Error occurred", awaitItem())
            expectNoEvents()
        }
    }
}
```

اختبار إعادة المحاولة التلقائية مع Exponential Backoff والتحقق من السلوك بالوقت الافتراضي:
```kotlin
class NetworkRetryEngine {
    suspend fun <T> fetchWithRetry(maxRetries: Int = 3, block: suspend () -> T): T {
        var attempts = 0
        while (true) {
            try {
                return block()
            } catch (e: IOException) {
                attempts++
                if (attempts >= maxRetries) throw e
                val delayMs = 1000L * (1 shl (attempts - 1)) // 1s, 2s, 4s...
                delay(delayMs)
            }
        }
    }
}

class RetryEngineTest {
    @Test
    fun `fetchWithRetry retries 3 times with exponential delays then succeeds`() = runTest {
        val engine = NetworkRetryEngine()
        var callCount = 0

        val deferredResult = async {
            engine.fetchWithRetry(maxRetries = 3) {
                callCount++
                if (callCount < 3) throw IOException("Network failed")
                "Success"
            }
        }

        // المحاولة 1: تفشل فوراً (callCount = 1) وتبدأ delay(1000)
        runCurrent()
        assertEquals(1, callCount)

        // التقدم بالوقت 1000ms: المحاولة 2 تفشل (callCount = 2) وتبدأ delay(2000)
        advanceTimeBy(1000)
        runCurrent()
        assertEquals(2, callCount)

        // التقدم بالوقت 2000ms: المحاولة 3 تنجح!
        advanceTimeBy(2000)
        runCurrent()
        assertEquals(3, callCount)
        assertEquals("Success", deferredResult.await())
    }
}
```

